cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "VizBind: a declarative RDF vocabulary for notation-independent visualization of RDFS/OWL models"
message: "If you use this software or vocabulary, please cite both the software (this file) and the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation)."
type: software
authors:
